    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sugar &amp; Rolling Stone&quot; is a retro style side view puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the explorer Rolling Stone and help Sugar, a girl with a magical key, reach the locked door safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various objects to create paths, solve puzzles, and enjoy their adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Sugar reach the goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar can't jump while carrying a heavy key, but don't worry\u2014there are many ways to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use cannons to launch Sugar across the map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to magical protection, Sugar will land safely no matter how far they fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/9242ed95914377d63d49730e86253e8a.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/9242ed95914377d63d49730e86253e8a.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/9242ed95914377d63d49730e86253e8a.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump together with Sugar using springs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find creative ways to overcome obstacles and reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/8784b5d0907df4d3a9f1a5a794c46b25.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/8784b5d0907df4d3a9f1a5a794c46b25.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/8784b5d0907df4d3a9f1a5a794c46b25.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gimmicks will help you solve puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Sugar and Rolling Stone on a magical journey!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sugar &amp; Rolling Stone&quot; is a retro style side view puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the explorer Rolling Stone and help Sugar, a girl with a magical key, reach the locked door safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various objects to create paths, solve puzzles, and enjoy their adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/682adcf912e0aa4bdb73ddf1170c8184.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Sugar reach the goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar can't jump while carrying a heavy key, but don't worry\u2014there are many ways to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.poster.avif?t=1750413612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.webm?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/797c7b3ebe4631d2b3535738ded18f22.mp4?t=1750413612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></